{"lyrics":"[00:00.08]Don't let these bitches get in your head (Wheezy Outta Here)\n[00:03.34]Fallin' out of love with Xanax\n[00:06.84]Livin' my life on the edge, I'm sacrificin' everything\n[00:14.28]I did Oxy', I don't need alcohol, I pop Rolexes like they Adderall\n[00:20.72]Continuin', deliverin' the substance, I'ma be there for my bros, one call\n[00:25.82]Don't you try and judge us like you ain't got no flaws\n[00:29.02]Don't you try and judge us, don't you try and trust us\n[00:34.88]Let it go down-down-down, ain't no issues\n[00:38.24]She gon' cry-cry-cry, she feel misused\n[00:41.10]Uh, she wanna kick it, she know judo, I cannot save her, I'm not a hero\n[00:44.72]Bank account commas and zeros, Gucci, Amiri, my apparel\n[00:47.94]Keep a pistol, let it hit ya', I'm official\n[00:51.16]Fuck that bitch, I will not kiss her, I won't miss her, uh\n[00:54.40]Make her cry-cry-cry, she need tissue\n[00:57.68]I get high-high-high, and have no issues\n[01:00.44]VVS on me, no igloo\n[01:02.02]You say you fly, but we been flew, uh, uh-uh\n[01:04.30]I told that bitch it ain't no way around it like Future\n[01:08.46]Come to find out, yesterday, she was fuckin' on Future\n[01:12.42]Stripper bitches callin' on my phone, they wanna know when I'll show up to the club\n[01:17.78]'Cause I throw hundreds in that bitch, ain't throwin' dubs\n[01:21.66]Spend a check, oh, money love, designer clothes, designer ho's, designer drugs\n[01:27.32]50K for the Birkin bag, did it just because\n[01:31.40]I'm in Chicago where they drill-drill-drill-drill\n[01:33.68]No Limit gang with me, yeah they real-real-real-real\n[01:37.68]FBG up in here, Future real-real-real-real\n[01:40.28]Perky pop, love the pills, mix it with Klonopins\n[01:43.26]Yeah, draped up when I walk into the club\n[01:47.60]Hundred racks in my pockets, ain't no dubs\n[01:50.80]Lot of Crip niggas spillin' lotta blood\n[01:54.02]Got a million-dollar ice just because\n[01:57.10]Exotic hoes, exotic clothes, exotic drugs\n[01:59.46]All hundreds in my bank, ain't find a dub\n[02:02.78]Blow some gas on that nigga, he a dub\n[02:06.98]Untamed make me feel-feel-feel-feel\n[02:09.90]No Limit gang whippin' that real-real-real-real\n[02:13.38]Rest in peace, you either kill or be killed\n[02:16.56]Bullets fly-fly-fly-fly, homicide-cide-cide, let's get high-high-high\n[02:24.60]Make her cry-cry-cry, she need tissue\n[02:27.92]I get high-high-high, and have no issues\n[02:30.62]VVS on me, no igloo\n[02:32.22]You say you fly, but we been flew, uh, uh-uh\n[02:35.12]You can see what we done been through\n[02:38.44]You didn't see the road we took, it was grimy\n[02:41.58]You don't know the way we been through\n[02:43.98]Bullets fly-fly-fly\n[02:47.24]Make you cry-cry-cry, cry-cry","words":[[0.08,0.3,"Don't"],[0.34,0.42,"let"],[0.48,0.62,"these"],[0.66,1.02,"bitches"],[1.1,1.28,"get"],[1.34,1.42,"in"],[1.46,1.62,"your"],[1.68,2.46,"head"],[2.5,2.72,"(Wheezy"],[2.76,2.88,"Outta"],[2.92,3.04,"Here)"],[3.34,3.82,"Fallin'"],[3.86,3.96,"out"],[4.02,4.04,"of"],[4.16,4.42,"love"],[4.46,4.56,"with"],[4.62,5.46,"Xanax"],[6.84,7.16,"Livin'"],[7.2,7.34,"my"],[7.46,7.7,"life"],[7.86,7.98,"on"],[8.02,8.32,"the"],[8.52,8.8,"edge,"],[8.84,10.3,"I'm"],[10.38,11.24,"sacrificin'"],[11.28,14.24,"everything"],[14.28,14.28,"I"],[14.32,14.42,"did"],[14.58,14.78,"Oxy',"],[14.82,14.82,"I"],[14.86,15.08,"don't"],[15.12,15.24,"need"],[15.42,16.0,"alcohol,"],[17.16,17.16,"I"],[17.28,17.48,"pop"],[17.52,18.0,"Rolexes"],[18.1,18.3,"like"],[18.4,18.6,"they"],[18.64,19.14,"Adderall"],[20.72,21.42,"Continuin',"],[21.46,22.26,"deliverin'"],[22.3,22.36,"the"],[22.42,23.08,"substance,"],[23.4,23.58,"I'ma"],[23.7,23.78,"be"],[23.88,24.0,"there"],[24.06,24.18,"for"],[24.4,24.42,"my"],[24.48,24.86,"bros,"],[25.04,25.16,"one"],[25.32,25.78,"call"],[25.82,25.94,"Don't"],[25.98,26.1,"you"],[26.14,26.2,"try"],[26.26,26.46,"and"],[26.56,27.06,"judge"],[27.24,27.34,"us"],[27.42,27.64,"like"],[27.72,27.76,"you"],[27.8,27.92,"ain't"],[27.96,28.12,"g